repository-code: "https://github.com/barah123/MicroFitGut"
url: "https://github.com/barah123/MicroFitGut"
abstract: >-
  MicroFitGut is a Claude Code plugin for downstream analysis of 16S amplicon and
  shotgun metagenomic data. It takes a feature table through quality control,
  normalization, alpha and beta diversity, differential abundance, mixed and
  zero-inflated models, publication figures, and a reproducible report. A
  reference library of sixteen documents encodes the analytical decisions while
  sixteen R modules perform the computation, and two auditing subagents check the
  result before publication. The tool refuses combinations that produce clean but
  incorrect results, and every number in its report traces to a logged artifact.
keywords:
